Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Use name for ubi mtd device instead of index

---
 arch/arm/boot/dts/rk3506g-luckfox-lyra-plus.dts | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm/boot/dts/rk3506g-luckfox-lyra-plus.dts b/arch/arm/boot/dts/rk3506g-luckfox-lyra-plus.dts
index 7b1ba6b69..fc7533f99 100644
